# 11: stereo. A stereo recording on a kit lane, and EDIT's STEREO / MONO box.
title STEREO
about A stereo recording on a drum lane plays in stereo. In its EDIT, up from the boxes is STEREO: hold A and press up for MONO, both sides in the middle.
caption STEREO
run --demo --view kit --samples $STEREO
# (not recorded: on SONG, X solos the drum track; back to the kit)
0.3 tap L2 2 0.3
1.0 tap X
1.4 tap R2 2 0.3
from 2.2
length 20.0

2.4 say Lane 6 plays a stereo recording: a ping-pong, left, right, left.
4.6 say A on the sound's picture opens its EDIT.
4.6 tap RIGHT 4 0.25
5.8 tap A
7.0 say A stereo recording says STEREO at the top. Up from the boxes goes there.
7.4 tap UP
9.0 say Hold A and press up: MONO. Both sides mixed into one, in the middle.
9.0 hold A 1.0
9.4 tap UP
13.4 say Hold A and press down: STEREO again, as the file is.
13.4 hold A 1.0
13.8 tap DOWN
16.6 say The file itself is never changed. It is kept with the song.
